  "details": "I am very happy that the number of favorite worlds that can be added to the playlist increases from time to time with updates. However, it is very difficult to open the pages of worlds that were added in the past because of the specification that the number of worlds that can be added per playlist is increasing. If the number of favorite playlists were expanded, I would not have to hesitate when adding a favorite world to the playlist, thinking that it would make the playlist less useful.\nAlso, if there are more playlists, it would be easier to separate the playlists to be added depending on the genre of the world when adding favorite worlds, which I think would be very convenient.",
